// Staff and voices.
//
// The Installation Wizard is Julia Tufts's part, and it is a VOICE, not a
// booth (`playable: false`, never on a picker): her lines are the tent
// tablet's script (the P-1 video) and they also land in each captured
// program's own `dm:Installation Wizard` thread (`Reinstallation`,
// beats/internet.loom). Julia runs the tent with the tablet's mod token
// (/reinstall/: scan the pass, Play here / Send to a headset). A release
// by hand is an Antivirus's ✅ Mark as reinstalled, or the director from
// Run (Inspector → Captured → Release).
//
// Sandy and Truther Download are voices too. Sandy only ever says one
// thing. Truther Download is the anonymous sender of the Truther Download
// and every per-program glitch prompt; its lines land in each program's
// own `dm:Truther Download` thread.

CHARACTER Installation Wizard
  playable: false
  // Julia's setup assistant. Next. Next. Are you sure? Finish.

CHARACTER Sandy
  playable: false
  // "It looks like I didn't understand that. Please wait while I direct you to an agent."

CHARACTER Truther Download
  playable: false
  // Every line is effect text on the phone (wave 13: the fx crawl).
  crawl: fx
  // THEY DON'T WANT YOU TO KNOW.
